<h2>What Corpus Christi Hail Damage Claims Typically Cover</h2>
<p>Hail is a covered peril on most property policies, subject to deductibles, exclusions, and endorsements. Near the coast, it is often covered by a TWIA windstorm policy rather than the homeowners policy; see <a href="/services/twia-windstorm-claims/">TWIA windstorm claims</a>. Hail claims often involve:</p>
